{
  "name": "dsh-getbrain",
  "version": "2.11.0",
  "private": true,
  "description": "正式 Cordis 插件（Bundle）：通过官方 OpenAPI 整理得到大脑（原 Get笔记）。本插件服务于「一个共享账号里混着三个人的内容」这一现实——同一个 Get笔记 账号同时装着我的工作与 AI 思考、孩子的学习与升学、老婆的部门会议，由我一个人维护分类；插件把内容按「我 / 孩子 / 老婆 / 共用 / 未知」分开，让 AI Agent 分清「谁的事」，而不是做多用户协作或多租户权限。全文字下载到统一数据目录（默认 = 仓库同级 data-getbrain，自动创建、不进 Git），默认只读、写操作需确认、删除双重闸门；附 SKILL.md 整理纪律。在「设置 → Mgetbrain」侧边栏配置 API Key/Client ID/dataDir 等，保存即时生效、无需重启；侧边栏 Mgetbrain 工作台提供真实的「知识库→目录→书→讲」层级树（本地重建）、分类调整（勾选层级→生成计划→干跑→双点真写）与真实审计日志。",
  "type": "module",
  "main": "index.js",
  "files": [
    "index.js",
    "client.js",
    "gn.py",
    "gn.ps1",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "config.example.json",
    "settings.example.json",
    "README.md",
    "SKILL.md",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "tools/*.mjs",
    "docs/*.md"
  ],
  "exports": {
    ".": "./index.js",
    "./client": "./client.js",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=18"
  },
  "keywords": [
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "cordis",
    "getnote",
    "biji",
    "notes",
    "knowledge-base",
    "pkm"
  ],
  "license": "MIT",
  "repository": {
    "type": "git",
    "url": "https://github.com/<your-account>/dsh-getbrain.git",
    "directory": "dsh-getbrain"
  },
  "homepage": "https://github.com/<your-account>/dsh-getbrain#readme",
  "bugs": {
    "url": "https://github.com/<your-account>/dsh-getbrain/issues"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "platform": "web",
      "immediately": true,
      "inject": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-settings-general",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-api-remotes",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-sidebar",
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-layout"
      ]
    }
  }
}
